  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot \u015Fimdi sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eimdi i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m \xDC\xE7l\xFCs\xFC\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    se\xE7tin.\n\nB\xFCy\xFCk emekler, b\xFCy\xFCk u\u011Fra\u015Flar ve b\xFCy\xFCk
    bir \xF6zveri... Ortaya koymakta oldu\u011Fun efor ger\xE7ekten takdire \u015Fayan
    {{isim}}. Kendini zaten kendine kan\u0131tlam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n; bu s\u0131ralar
    \xE7evrene de kan\u0131tl\u0131yorsun. Yeteneklerini sana uzak olan insanlar
    dahi g\xF6rmeye ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015Flar. Yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n ya da yapmaya
    \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n \u015Feyler her ne ise, \xE7ok b\xFCy\xFCk
    \xF6l\xE7ekli g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor. Hayat\u0131na dair son dokunu\u015Flar\u0131,
    son d\xFCzenlemeleri yap\u0131yorsun. Ortaya m\xFCthi\u015F bir \"{{isim}}\"
    ve fevkalade bir eser \xE7\u0131kmakta. Detaylara verdi\u011Fin \xF6nem ve kendini
    hayallerine aday\u0131\u015F \u015Feklin, senin ba\u015Far\u0131n\u0131n en temel
    kayna\u011F\u0131. Bu \xF6zenin devam etti\u011Fi s\xFCrece, s\u0131rt\u0131n\u0131
    yere getirebilecek hi\xE7bir \u015Fey yok."
